    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 25.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ond se biscop amonige þa oferhyrnesse æt þam gerefan, þe hit on his folgoþe sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the fine for insubordination shall be exacted from the reeve by the bishop, within whose diocese the offence is perpetrated.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se bisceope amanige ða oferhyrnysse æt ðæm gerefan, ðe on his folgoþe sy.</ab>
